## Skill Tree Lines

**What it does:** Journal prerequisite link sprites, gold glow strength, and line thickness.

**Where:**
- Studio: `Genesis Studio / UI / Skill Tree Lines` (panel mode `SingletonAsset`)
- Asset: `Assets/_Project/Resources/UI/Skills/Tree/DMSkillTreeLineProfile.asset`
- Script: `Assets/_Project/Scripts/UI/DMSkillTreeLineProfile.cs`

**Key settings** (from code):

| Group | Field | Type | Default | Range | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Sprites (optional overrides) | `pathCore` | Sprite |  |  | Default horizontal line strip. Resources/UI/Skills/Tree/skill_path_core |
| Sprites (optional overrides) | `pathGlow` | Sprite |  |  | Gold glow strip behind the core. Resources/UI/Skills/Tree/skill_path_glow |
| Sprites (optional overrides) | `pathLocked` | Sprite |  |  | Optional per-state cores; tint still applies if set. |
| Sprites (optional overrides) | `pathReady` | Sprite |  |  |  |
| Sprites (optional overrides) | `pathOwned` | Sprite |  |  |  |
| Thickness (pixels) | `coreHeight` | float | 5f |  |  |
| Thickness (pixels) | `glowHeight` | float | 13f |  |  |
| Gold glow strength | `glowAlphaLocked` | float | 0.1f | 0f–1f |  |
| Gold glow strength | `glowAlphaReady` | float | 0.42f | 0f–1f |  |
| Gold glow strength | `glowAlphaOwned` | float | 0.78f | 0f–1f |  |
| Core tints (when using shared core sprite) | `usePaletteTints` | bool | true |  |  |

